  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/807db8ce-eb88-45c1-8f61-0a842c06949c-image.png\" style=\"width: 232px; height: 120px;\" /><br /><br />The frequency of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;block is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>Hz</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>,&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Spring constant,&nbsp;<math><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />In parallel connection&nbsp;of springs, the equivalent spring constant is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></math>.&nbsp;<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0b25af05-9389-4393-bf2d-e44a88299d70-image.png\" style=\"width: 232px; height: 120px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br />Frequency of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;block is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p>",
